Package: krr
Title: Kernel Ridge Regression for Phonological Analogy
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Peter", "Racz", email = "petermartonracz@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fit kernel ridge regression models on precomputed phonological
    distances and predict morphological behaviour for new words. Supports
    leave-one-out hyperparameter tuning, logit link transformation, and
    input validation. Ships with a Hungarian lakok/lakom dataset as a
    worked example.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
